---
import DnaAscentPrototype from "../../../components/kodex/organism/prototypes/DnaAscentPrototype.astro";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>KODEX−∞ DNA Ascent Lab</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="lab">
      <header class="lab__header">
        <div class="lab__eyebrow">
          <span>KODEX−∞ // INTERNAL LAB</span>
          <span>KOD-39 SUPPORT</span>
          <span>STATUS: TESTED PROTOTYPE</span>
        </div>
        <h1>DNA ASCENT</h1>
        <p>
          Prototipo aislado y reversible para reducir riesgo técnico mientras el paquete local exacto
          <code>KOD-39.yaml</code> se sincroniza al repositorio. Este laboratorio NO declara KOD-39 completado.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="lab__stage" aria-labelledby="stage-title">
        <div class="lab__metadata">
          <span>CONCEPT: RECORRIDO DEL CÓDIGO VIVO</span>
          <span>RENDER: CANVAS 2D</span>
          <span>DEPENDENCY: ZERO</span>
          <span>PUBLIC ROUTE: UNTOUCHED</span>
        </div>
        <h2 id="stage-title">AXIAL HELIX / INTERACTION STUDY</h2>
        <DnaAscentPrototype />
      </section>

      <aside class="lab__notes">
        <div>
          <h2>BEHAVIOR</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Vertical double-helix ascent around a stable Z axis.</li>
            <li>Pointer/touch shifts depth and optical center.</li>
            <li>Click/tap/Enter/Space toggles signal engagement.</li>
            <li>Visibility suspension prevents background rendering.</li>
            <li>Mobile DPR is capped at 1; desktop at 1.5.</li>
            <li>Reduced-motion uses a static rendered state.</li>
            <li>SVG fallback remains available if Canvas 2D cannot initialize.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>TRUTH STATUS</h2>
          <dl>
            <dt>DNA ASCENT visual</dt>
            <dd>TESTED PROTOTYPE</dd>
            <dt>Exact KOD-39 contract</dt>
            <dd>NEEDS_LOCAL_SYNC</dd>
            <dt>Build/static route</dt>
            <dd>VERIFIED · CI</dd>
            <dt>Browser QA</dt>
            <dd>VERIFIED · 390/412/1440</dd>
            <dt>Screenshot review</dt>
            <dd>REVIEWED · LAB ONLY</dd>
            <dt>Deployment</dt>
            <dd>BLOCKED</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>QA EVIDENCE</h2>
          <ol>
            <li>Astro build and generated lab route pass in GitHub Actions.</li>
            <li>390×844, 412×915 and 1440×1000 browser gates pass without horizontal overflow.</li>
            <li>Keyboard engagement reaches <code>ENGAGED</code>.</li>
            <li>Reduced-motion context reaches <code>REDUCED</code>.</li>
            <li>Browser console and page-error collections are empty.</li>
            <li>QA screenshots are stored as workflow artifacts.</li>
            <li>Exact local KOD-39 requirements must still be synchronized before scene integration.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { color-scheme: dark; background: #020203; }
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100dvh;
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgb(255 255 255 / 0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
      #020203;
    background-size: 28px 28px;
    color: #e9e5f2;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  }

  .lab {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(17rem, 23rem);
    gap: 1rem;
    width: min(100%, 98rem);
    min-height: 100dvh;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .lab__header,
  .lab__stage,
  .lab__notes {
    border: 1px solid rgb(233 229 242 / 0.22);
    background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.78);
  }

  .lab__header {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .lab__eyebrow,
  .lab__metadata {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #9b85ff;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  p { margin-block: 0 0.75rem; }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 9vw, 8rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 0.82;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .lab__header p,
  .lab__notes {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .lab__stage {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .lab__notes {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .lab__notes ul,
  .lab__notes ol {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }

  .lab__notes li + li { margin-top: 0.45rem; }

  dl {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  dt { color: rgb(233 229 242 / 0.58); }
  dd { margin: 0; color: #aee7ff; }
  code { color: #c8baff; }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .lab { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 0.65rem; }
    .lab__header { grid-column: auto; }
    .lab__eyebrow { justify-content: flex-start; }
  }
</style>
